{"title":"2003 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a67a05fe5380c7c9e4f32ae1b04313c63b0d597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{169} - \\sqrt{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/3106dc05e18b1a6058d45e2d7cf0fd39c57dad47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 64 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 72 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply evaluate the expression:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e93e5f0c7cf0a68eee2fc7bc324ffde75767278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{169} - \\sqrt{25} = 13 - 5 = \\boxed {\\textbf{(A) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"254\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202346\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest exp